# A Knight's Test (sandoria 29, PLD unlock): Balasiel, Baunise and Cahaurme in Southern San d'Oria, the Disused Well in
# Davoi. The guard (A Squire's Test II completed, level ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 30): A Squire's Test II's 625 while it is not
# completed; a trade while available (no trade handler: nothing); Baunise before the quest (no section: NOTHING_TO_REPORT); the offer 627 declined (Option 1), 635 declined
# and taken (the Book of Tasks, begun); Balasiel's 669; the well with no book (nil: A_WELL), Baunise's 634 (the Book of
# the West) and DO_NOT_FRET, the well with one book (A_WELL), Cahaurme's 633 (the Book of the East) and
# TRIAL_IS_DIFFICULT, the well with both (the Knight's Soul) and again (YOU_FIND_NOTHING); Balasiel's 628 (completed:
# Kite Shield, the Paladin gesture, fame +20, Tried and Tested Knight; PLD unlocked, UNLOCK_PALADIN, the four key items
# deleted); the completed messages YOUVE_DONE_WELL and MAKE_EXCELLENT_KNIGHT (replaceDefault); Balasiel's default 667
# (Methods Create Madness needs polearm skill 240). Baunise and Cahaurme have no script, default NOTHING_TO_REPORT; the
# Disused Well's default is A_WELL.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Balasiel/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Balasiel/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/Baunise/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Cahaurme/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/627 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/635 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/628 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/633 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/634 Davoi/Disused_Well/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-136.8,-10.8,65.8 lvl=30
quest Sandoria.ASquiresTest completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Balasiel                          # A Squire's Test II not completed: its 625
finish                                    # A Squire's Test II begun
quest Sandoria.ASquiresTestIi completed
trade Balasiel BoneChip x1                # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Baunise                           # available: no section, NOTHING_TO_REPORT
trigger Balasiel                          # level 30, Option 0: 627
finish option=1                           # not option 0: Option 1
trigger Balasiel                          # Option 1: 635
finish option=1                           # not option 0: nothing
trigger Balasiel                          # 635
finish                                    # option 0: the Book of Tasks, begun
trigger Balasiel                          # accepted, no soul: 669
finish
warp -220.1,2.8,-295.4 Davoi
trigger Disused_Well                      # no book: nil, A_WELL
warp -54.2,-8.6,-29.3 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Baunise                           # no Book of the West: 634
finish                                    # the Book of the West
trigger Baunise                           # the book held: DO_NOT_FRET
warp -220.1,2.8,-295.4 Davoi
trigger Disused_Well                      # the West book only: nil, A_WELL
warp 57.2,-8.6,-29.4 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Cahaurme                          # no Book of the East: 633
finish                                    # the Book of the East
trigger Cahaurme                          # the book held: TRIAL_IS_DIFFICULT
warp -220.1,2.8,-295.4 Davoi
trigger Disused_Well                      # both books, no soul: the key item Knight's Soul
trigger Disused_Well                      # the soul held: YOU_FIND_NOTHING
warp -136.8,-10.8,65.8 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Balasiel                          # the soul: 628
finish                                    # completed: Kite Shield, the gesture, fame +20, the title; PLD unlocked, UNLOCK_PALADIN; four KIs deleted
trigger Baunise                           # completed: YOUVE_DONE_WELL
trigger Cahaurme                          # completed: MAKE_EXCELLENT_KNIGHT
trigger Balasiel                          # completed: no section; Methods Create Madness not offered (skill 0): 667
finish
